{
  "_notes": [
    "One shared home for the GGG gem trade-search request body (POE-429 D08). Each case: gem + variant + mode -> full expected body.",
    "mode 'normal' cases come from Go buildSearchQuery (internal/trade/client.go); mode 'dedication' cases come from Rust build_search_query_with_mode(..., true) (desktop/src-tauri/src/trade/query.rs).",
    "Deliberate difference 1: TS baseGemTradeUrl omits the empty query.stats clause ([{\"type\":\"and\",\"filters\":[]}]) that Go and Rust emit, so TS compares against the expected body minus query.stats.",
    "Deliberate difference 2: Go has no Dedication mode, so Go skips mode 'dedication'.",
    "Deliberate difference 3: TS's Dedication link (cheapestCorruptedTradeUrl) is a colour search with no gem name, not this query, so TS skips mode 'dedication'.",
    "Deliberate difference 4: TS baseGemTradeUrl is the 'Buy Base' link and searches the base gem by type, so TS skips normal-mode cases whose gem contains ' of '."
  ],
